  "notes": "Adds Series as the eighth first-class Tags tab with independent font/color, text gradient, background gradient, border/radius/padding, hover styling, preview styling, AO3 CSS output, CSS edit-state round-trip, and per-skin persistence. Adds a Whole Skin / Global Style panel with a reversible Font for Everything override and an All Text override that can be off, one solid color, or one global gradient. Global overrides do not erase the individual text settings underneath; turning them off restores the per-element styling."
